WEBVTT

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:05.880
We will arrive at Lake Kannawa momentarily.

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:08.480
Please be patient just 
a bit longer, Empress.

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:10.490
Got it.

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:16.520
It's bad for your health to hold it 
when you need to pee, Empress.

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:18.000
It's not that!

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.900
I mean, yeah, I'm kinda cold 
in this weird pilot suit,

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:20.200
Asagi

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.720
but there's something 
making it even more... Huh?

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.670
Why is the outside air temperature so low?!

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.730
What the heck is going on?

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.000
What now?!

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.290
Unknown. I believe this signal is...

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:37.190
Magical beasts!

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:39.300
What?!

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:42.740
To strike first assures victory! 
Time to launch our attack!

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:48.020
Wait a second, Tank!

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:49.300
Don't shoot that way!

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:50.340
Empress?

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:52.370
Look in front of us! 
There's a kid standing there!

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:56.790
Knowing what is right and not doing it is...

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:58.320
Forgive me, Empress!

00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:00.370
Wait, what are you—

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:03.450
Boy, we have this area covered!

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:05.090
Retreat now, while you can!

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:11.280
Got 'em!

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:22.950
Good grief.

00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:27.100
You leap in front of me in a piece 
of junk like that, only to embarrass yourself?

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:29.990
<i>Still, I acknowledge your willingness</i>

00:01:29.990 --> 00:01:34.040
<i>to risk your own life to save me, 
injudicious though it was.</i>

00:01:34.520 --> 00:01:37.920
That power... Are you...

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:40.590
from the Dynasty 
of Destruction in the Caucasus...

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:42.010
<i>Oh?</i>

00:01:42.010 --> 00:01:45.540
<i>So there's someone out here 
in this backwater who knows me?</i>

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:50.000
I am a direct descendant 
of the Second Progenitor, Foregazer,

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.730
and ruler of the Eight Northern Provinces 
of the Dynasty of Destruction...

00:01:53.730 --> 00:01:56.020
Iblisveil Aziz.

00:01:56.450 --> 00:01:57.920
Be honored.

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:40.230
Hisano-sama!

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:44.640
I'm glad you're all right, Haba Yuiri.

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:48.770
Yuiri! Yuiri! Yuiri!

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:50.540
I'm sorry. I lost sight of Nagisa-san.

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:54.880
Yuiri! Yuiri! Yuiri! Yuiri!

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:52.320
I know.

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:54.720
You did very well.

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:56.500
And... who is this girl?

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:56.510
Yuiri!

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:59.970
Um... I don't know.

00:03:59.970 --> 00:04:02.530
I just found her and brought her with me.

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:05.240
She seems quite attached to you.

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:07.920
Well... yes, for some reason...

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:15.520
Haba Yuiri, I would like you 
to guard the wounded JSDF members.

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:18.820
Take the girl and retreat to Gotemba.

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:20.300
Y-Yes, ma'am.

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:24.040
Listen to me. Do not take 
your eyes off of this girl.

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:25.650
I'm counting on you.

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:29.450
<b>Bath</b>

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:29.450
<b>Women</b>

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:29.450
<b>Bath</b>

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:29.450
<b>Men</b>

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:29.450
Asagi is close to here?

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:33.450
<i>Yeah, though she's kind 
of lost at the moment...</i>

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:35.620
What?! Is she okay?!

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:38.300
<i>She's with that tank girl,</i>

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:40.690
<i>so I don't think we need to worry.</i>

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:44.090
That "Didier" girl?

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:46.320
But why is Asagi on the mainland, too?

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:50.470
<i>Oh, she probably wants to show you 
that she can be helpful, too.</i>

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:52.150
And she thought she'd show me <i>that</i> way?!

00:04:52.150 --> 00:04:53.300
Oh, my.

00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:56.830
I see you're as popular 
with the ladies as ever, Akatsuki Kojou.

00:04:56.830 --> 00:04:59.490
K-Kisaki?! Wha— Why—

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:01.480
And why are you in a towel?!

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:02.800
Don't worry.

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:05.460
I'll remove it before I get in the water.

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:06.450
Peek?

00:05:08.140 --> 00:05:10.880
That's rather embarrassing to actually <i>do</i>...

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:13.180
Then get out of here already!

00:05:13.340 --> 00:05:15.410
I was just pretending! Ta-da!

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:17.420
Ta... Ta-da?! You—

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.750
A-A swimsuit?!

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:22.260
Are you disappointed? Are you disappointed?

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:24.930
I'm not disappointed!

00:05:24.930 --> 00:05:27.270
Wait, why are you getting in?!

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:30.940
Hey, quit staring!

00:05:32.280 --> 00:05:35.150
It looked like you still haven't 
regained feeling in your right hand.

00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:39.940
The spell to generate 
the barrier, Paper Noise,

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:42.790
was most likely intended to seal you

00:05:42.790 --> 00:05:45.160
using divine vibrations.

00:05:45.630 --> 00:05:47.590
Seal me, huh?

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:49.030
That makes sense.

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:51.280
Isn't there any way to get rid of it?

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:52.420
Who knows?

00:05:52.420 --> 00:05:55.050
Would you like to try sucking 
my blood, for starters?

00:05:55.360 --> 00:05:57.810
I won't tell Himeragi Yukina.

00:05:57.810 --> 00:06:00.980
That's such a lie. You have 
every intention of telling her.

00:06:00.980 --> 00:06:03.830
Oh, what a surprise. However did you know?

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:04.890
Jeez...

00:06:04.890 --> 00:06:08.490
If you just wanted to tease me, 
haven't you done that enough?

00:06:08.490 --> 00:06:09.590
Just get out of here.

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:12.220
No, I haven't come to the real point yet.

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:14.980
I came to say goodbye.

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:15.920
Huh?

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:18.670
I've been summoned by the Taishi Bureau.

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:23.020
They've ordered me to clean up a swarm of 
magical beasts that appeared at Lake Kannawa.

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:24.870
Magical beasts... at Lake Kannawa?

00:06:25.470 --> 00:06:29.100
It seems the Lion King Organization's 
plans ran awry.

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:33.340
Or perhaps this is how 
they wanted it to end...

00:06:34.110 --> 00:06:36.970
So long as we both live, 
I'm sure we'll meet again.

00:06:36.970 --> 00:06:40.790
When we do, I hope we can 
truly bare all to one another.

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:43.600
Wait, Kisaki! What's going on?

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:44.850
What happened at Lake Kannawa?!

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:48.880
Kisaki-san! What are you 
doing in the men's bath?

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:51.390
What happened to that warding barrier...

00:06:52.230 --> 00:06:54.350
H-Himeragi?

00:06:57.840 --> 00:06:59.960
Senpai, you...

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:00.660
Wait, wait...

00:06:59.960 --> 00:07:03.110
You jerk!

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:06.820
Why?!

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:12.580
Gosh, to think you blew away all 
those magical beasts in a mere instant.

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:15.610
That Familiar was incredible, was it not?

00:07:15.610 --> 00:07:18.100
For real. That was unbelievable.

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:20.640
A little stunt like that was nothing.

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:21.660
More importantly...

00:07:22.020 --> 00:07:24.950
Do you eat this directly from the container?

00:07:24.950 --> 00:07:27.050
Yeah. What, you've never had it before?

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:37.760
It's good.

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:39.040
Right?

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:41.360
The boiling point is lower 
at high altitudes,

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:43.200
so the key is to wait 
a little longer for it.

00:07:48.310 --> 00:07:51.210
Lydianne, and... 
you said your name was Asagi?

00:07:51.210 --> 00:07:53.280
You two are quite strange.

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:54.940
Huh? We are?

00:07:55.480 --> 00:07:56.990
Is that so?

00:07:57.160 --> 00:08:02.990
I haven't encountered many people who didn't 
adopt a servile attitude upon meeting me.

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:06.570
We know you don't mean us any harm.

00:08:06.570 --> 00:08:08.300
Why would we be scared of you?

00:08:08.560 --> 00:08:11.520
Besides, I grew up 
on Itogami Island, you know.

00:08:11.660 --> 00:08:12.960
I see.

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:16.520
I visited there before coming here. 
So you live on that island?

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:17.520
That explains it.

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:19.200
Exactly.

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:23.040
Iblis, since you stopped by 
Itogami Island before coming here,

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:23.990
will you stop by again on your way home?

00:08:24.180 --> 00:08:26.970
Perhaps. Why do you ask?

00:08:26.970 --> 00:08:31.660
If you do, you might want to check out 
Toushouken at the International Terminal!

00:08:31.660 --> 00:08:36.360
Oh, but Noodle Shop Itogami's rich 
pork back fat ramen is great, too...

00:08:36.360 --> 00:08:39.230
No, wait... There's also Tsukemen Pacific...

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:44.130
You really are a strange one!

00:08:45.320 --> 00:08:48.000
Wait... is that an exasperated reaction?

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:52.230
So... what was that back there?

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:56.410
Dragons exist to protect.

00:08:56.410 --> 00:08:58.660
Maybe these ruins were a bullseye.

00:08:58.660 --> 00:08:59.820
Bullseye?

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:04.090
Whatever the case, 
slaying monsters isn't our domain.

00:09:04.090 --> 00:09:08.020
With the JSDF in that state, 
we can't count on them, either.

00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:10.000
Actually, those guys...

00:09:11.240 --> 00:09:17.050
I mean, the Special Attack Mage Regiment... 
seemed to go down awfully easily.

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:18.970
Now that you mention it...

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:27.040
Hisano-sama?!

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:30.710
Hey, old hag. Did you kill all these guys?

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:32.880
You really believe that's possible?

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:35.710
I only stumbled upon them a moment ago.

00:09:35.710 --> 00:09:40.510
It looked as if they were fighting 
to protect something.

00:09:41.670 --> 00:09:42.890
Gajou?

00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:46.890
Shio-chan, you can use physical 
enchantment spells, right?

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:49.810
Take Nagisa and get as far away 
from here as you can.

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:57.160
A w-wyvern?!

00:09:57.510 --> 00:10:00.330
That must be who wiped out all these beasts.

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:03.160
If so, then his objective must be...

00:10:03.860 --> 00:10:06.380
The calamity of Lake Kannawa itself!

00:10:13.350 --> 00:10:14.790
What's going on?!

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:21.560
Old hag!

00:10:21.990 --> 00:10:23.470
Go now, Shio-chan!

00:10:30.680 --> 00:10:32.280
No way...

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:40.220
Run, Shio...

00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:44.280
You two... have to...

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:48.240
Sagara!

00:10:55.830 --> 00:10:58.330
Iblis-dono, that magic was—

00:10:58.330 --> 00:10:59.060
I know.

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:00.770
Hurry!

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:03.420
Who are you?

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:14.350
Kira, Tobias... You can handle that one.

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:17.110
Show him your finest hospitality.

00:11:24.900 --> 00:11:26.990
We are a bit ahead of schedule,

00:11:26.990 --> 00:11:28.640
but this makes the third.

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:36.550
Vatler-san?! What are you doing here?

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:38.670
<i>So that's Akatsuki Nagisa...</i>

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:41.380
<i>The Fourth Progenitor's younger sister?</i>

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:45.340
Well, well, if it isn't 
His Highness Iblisveil Aziz.

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:50.320
And of all things, you've brought 
the Priestess of Cain with you.

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:52.140
The Priestess of Cain?

00:11:53.320 --> 00:11:56.720
Well, no matter. 
More importantly, Vatler, is that...

00:11:56.830 --> 00:11:57.730
Yes.

00:11:57.840 --> 00:12:00.560
An armed agent of the Holy Massacre Faction.

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:03.620
The Knight of the Sinful God... I see.

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:06.110
So that's why you've come here.

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:09.430
Asagi, take those humans and leave here.

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:11.530
Take Akatsuki Nagisa, as well.

00:12:12.630 --> 00:12:15.100
You have no complaint 
with that, do you, Vatler?

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:16.550
Of course not.

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:23.470
Kira Voltisloa and the other one are losing?

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:24.690
Interesting.

00:12:37.550 --> 00:12:39.850
You dare point a blade at me?

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:41.750
Know your place!

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:48.900
Rip out their entrails, Meretseger!

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:54.250
The power of Nod, eh?

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:06.800
Transforming the air 
into deadly, acidic poison...

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:11.900
This Familiar, Meretseger, 
belonged to Second Princess Mavia.

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:15.920
Did you think you were the only 
one who'd consumed a family member?

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:19.510
I was humiliated during the Blazing Banquet,

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:23.250
but I took revenge by consuming 
the traitor in my family.

00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:26.450
What's the matter, Knight of the Sinful God?

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:27.690
Are you done already?

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:33.180
What?!

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:40.650
He's running away? No, he's retreating.

00:13:40.650 --> 00:13:42.180
Impudent bastard.

00:13:44.230 --> 00:13:47.840
Vatler, I will be the one to destroy him.

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:49.140
You have no complaint with that, do you?

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:51.170
The fanatics loyal to the Sinful God, Cain,

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:54.140
who seek to reenact the holy war...

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:58.300
To destroy them along 
with the Sinful God has long been

00:13:58.300 --> 00:14:01.300
the wish of the descendants 
of the Warlord, including myself.

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:06.120
I have orders from our king 
to annihilate them at all costs.

00:14:06.370 --> 00:14:09.570
Oh? Do you want to fight me for it, then?

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:12.000
Certainly not.

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:14.530
Please do as you wish, Your Highness.

00:14:14.820 --> 00:14:18.390
I still have another objective I must fulfill.

00:14:22.020 --> 00:14:24.460
Hmph. Cunning bastard.

00:14:35.120 --> 00:14:37.150
So what's your name?

00:14:38.070 --> 00:14:40.630
Mine's Yuiri. What's yours?

00:14:40.630 --> 00:14:41.940
Glenda!

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:44.890
Glenda? That's your name?

00:14:44.890 --> 00:14:46.350
Yeah! Glenda!

00:14:46.620 --> 00:14:47.840
Glenda...

00:14:48.640 --> 00:14:49.830
It's here.

00:14:51.010 --> 00:14:53.000
It's here? What is?

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:57.910
Attack Mage Haba, look!

00:15:03.190 --> 00:15:05.500
An automata... no...

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:06.920
Is it a golem?

00:15:07.120 --> 00:15:10.480
But... what is this creepy feeling?

00:15:10.480 --> 00:15:13.360
Rosen Chevalier Plus, boot up!

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:20.400
Run now, while you can!

00:15:22.830 --> 00:15:24.000
What's happening?

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:26.600
Is this... alchemy?!

00:15:28.470 --> 00:15:30.030
I found you...

00:15:30.310 --> 00:15:31.510
Glenda.

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:40.420
Take this!

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:46.090
Yuiri!

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:51.920
Yuiri!

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:53.220
Run, Glenda!

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:13.200
Glenda...

00:16:13.770 --> 00:16:15.520
Just what are you?

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:17.990
I've been waiting!

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:25.250
Glenda!

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:26.850
Get her.

00:16:31.040 --> 00:16:33.270
<i>No... I can't get to her.</i>

00:16:33.750 --> 00:16:36.970
<i>Someone, please... save her!</i>

00:16:37.530 --> 00:16:38.680
Schneesturm Wolfin!

00:16:40.150 --> 00:16:41.850
Regulus Aurum!

00:16:46.990 --> 00:16:48.930
Are you all right, Yuiri-san?

00:16:54.860 --> 00:16:56.170
Yukki!

00:16:58.320 --> 00:17:00.770
So that's the golems' boss?

00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:03.880
Fourth Progenitor...

00:17:04.510 --> 00:17:05.390
Senpai!

00:17:07.510 --> 00:17:10.300
Damn it! Regulus Aurum!

00:17:15.570 --> 00:17:16.770
Its attacks aren't working?!

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:18.920
Just like with the Dark Oath Grimoire...

00:17:20.960 --> 00:17:21.910
Wait!

00:17:25.110 --> 00:17:27.060
Senpai! Wasn't that hand the one...

00:17:28.100 --> 00:17:30.160
Yeah, sorta.

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:33.010
Anyway, Himeragi, where are 
that girl and the dragon?

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:35.990
D-Don't look!

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:45.590
I am a War Dancer 
of the Lion King Organization.

00:17:45.810 --> 00:17:50.440
My name is Hikawa Shio, 
Your Highness Iblisveil Aziz.

00:17:50.680 --> 00:17:54.090
Then... Shio, you said? 
Why don't you tell me what's going on?

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:56.900
What is it you people are after?

00:17:56.900 --> 00:17:59.460
Why did the Holy War Faction appear here?

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:04.480
I... cannot answer that.

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:09.250
Oh? You refuse to answer my question?

00:18:09.250 --> 00:18:11.920
I don't dislike a faithful dog,

00:18:11.920 --> 00:18:15.410
but if you will not repay your debt 
to the one who saved your life,

00:18:15.410 --> 00:18:16.720
you will be disciplined—

00:18:16.720 --> 00:18:21.500
The Lion King Organization's 
goal is to seal Avalon.

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:25.950
Before we knew it, 
the whole lake had frozen,

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:28.120
and then the magical beasts showed up.

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:31.720
Gajou! Should you be moving around?

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:33.060
I'll manage.

00:18:33.410 --> 00:18:38.640
So, Prince, try not to pick on this 
hard-working young lady too much.

00:18:38.870 --> 00:18:41.720
The Netherworld Revenant, Akatsuki Gajou?

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:44.240
You're just as impertinent as I had heard.

00:18:44.240 --> 00:18:46.760
Very well, you'll do. Explain.

00:18:47.170 --> 00:18:48.700
What is Avalon?

00:18:48.920 --> 00:18:50.770
A relic of the holy war...

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:54.010
Ostensibly, at least.

00:18:54.010 --> 00:18:56.750
It's a god-killing weapon 
that the Devas sealed away.

00:18:57.870 --> 00:18:59.280
I see.

00:18:59.280 --> 00:19:04.470
So they tried to seal the holy war relic 
with the magic of Dodekatos.

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:08.160
That means this ice field 
is the work of Alrescha Glacies.

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:12.250
If this Avalon were merely 
a god-killing weapon,

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:14.250
perhaps it really could have been sealed.

00:19:14.360 --> 00:19:17.700
But then... what was it 
that they actually sealed?

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:18.720
A relic...

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:21.830
The first thing that word brings to mind is

00:19:21.830 --> 00:19:24.270
some sort of treasure or prized possession.

00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:27.410
The thing that's been sleeping 
down there is no weapon.

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:28.460
Most likely,

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:30.010
it's a ritual item or sacred vessel

00:19:30.010 --> 00:19:33.110
capable of granting the qualification 
to succeed the Sinful God.

00:19:33.110 --> 00:19:36.790
That would explain why 
it's been so well-guarded.

00:19:36.910 --> 00:19:38.470
Guarded?

00:19:38.470 --> 00:19:41.280
Does that mean the dragon 
we saw was guarding it?

00:19:41.590 --> 00:19:45.200
A dragon? You saw a dragon?!

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:48.280
Y-Yes, but only for a moment...

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:51.810
Are you talking about an actual dragon?

00:19:51.810 --> 00:19:55.760
I'd think if one of those showed up, 
it'd be pretty easy to find.

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:59.060
And there are still a lot 
of JSDF guys in this area.

00:19:59.610 --> 00:20:02.860
JSDF... Of course! That's it!

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:05.970
Akatsuki Gajou!

00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:08.860
Asagi.

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:12.270
Stay in the tank with Lydianne 
for the time being.

00:20:12.720 --> 00:20:15.660
You don't want to cause trouble 
for the local authorities.

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:24.010
Yeah, there's no way we could 
make any excuses for this tank...

00:20:24.010 --> 00:20:25.220
All yours, then!

00:20:25.360 --> 00:20:27.110
Who are they?

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:30.460
That's Major Azama of the JSDF.

00:20:30.460 --> 00:20:32.460
He was the commander of this operation.

00:20:33.280 --> 00:20:34.750
I see.

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:41.180
I mean, the Special Attack Mage Regiment... 
seemed to go down awfully easily.

00:20:41.780 --> 00:20:42.870
It couldn't be!

00:20:43.950 --> 00:20:46.030
Attack Mage Hikawa,

00:20:46.030 --> 00:20:47.100
who are these people?

00:20:47.320 --> 00:20:49.470
Is Shamaness Akatsuki injured?

00:20:49.660 --> 00:20:50.540
Yes.

00:20:50.990 --> 00:20:53.340
Is he a demon?

00:20:53.340 --> 00:20:56.250
I'd like you to tell me all 
about him in detail later.

00:20:56.250 --> 00:20:58.440
Taking care of the wounded comes first.

00:20:58.660 --> 00:21:03.010
Let's start with her. 
Please give Akatsuki Nagisa-san to us.

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:06.480
Unfortunately, I cannot follow that order.

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:13.540
Don't move, Major Azama.

00:21:15.270 --> 00:21:18.140
So Nagisa's safe for now, then?

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:19.220
Asagi and the rest, too?

00:21:19.220 --> 00:21:22.300
<i>Yeah, and your dad and grandma, as well.</i>

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:24.350
I don't care about my dad...

00:21:24.350 --> 00:21:26.520
But that's a relief.

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:30.530
Tell Asagi and the rest that it'll take 
a bit longer before we can join them.

00:21:30.530 --> 00:21:31.780
Right, you got it.

00:21:33.040 --> 00:21:35.240
That's great to hear, Senpai.

00:21:35.420 --> 00:21:36.030
Yeah.

00:21:36.450 --> 00:21:37.650
I'm sorry!

00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:42.100
I was supposed to be guarding 
your sister, but I lost her,

00:21:42.100 --> 00:21:45.090
and she ended up in danger...

00:21:45.090 --> 00:21:48.420
Y-Yeah... But she turned out to be okay.

00:21:48.420 --> 00:21:50.740
No, this was a failure on my part.

00:21:51.040 --> 00:21:52.920
I'm truly sorry.

00:21:53.410 --> 00:21:57.240
Hey, Himeragi, is she really 
from the Lion King Organization?

00:21:57.780 --> 00:22:00.580
Yes, she's a year older than me.

00:22:00.580 --> 00:22:03.290
She was a very promising Sword Shaman cadet.

00:22:03.440 --> 00:22:04.550
I see.

00:22:06.030 --> 00:22:09.120
Oh, it's just... for someone 
from the Lion King Organization,

00:22:09.120 --> 00:22:11.670
she seems to really have her act together.

00:22:11.670 --> 00:22:12.400
Excuse me?

00:22:12.400 --> 00:22:14.400
Yuiri!

00:22:14.560 --> 00:22:17.110
Yuiri!

00:22:17.210 --> 00:22:20.610
Good for you, Glenda! 
They gave you some clothes!

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:24.100
Yuiri!

00:22:24.450 --> 00:22:26.620
Hey, who's that girl?

00:22:27.040 --> 00:22:29.180
I don't know much about her, either.

00:22:29.180 --> 00:22:33.440
She only just told me earlier 
that her name is Glenda.

00:22:33.710 --> 00:22:35.910
Yuiri, they're here again.

00:22:41.990 --> 00:22:44.550
You are Attack Mage Haba 
of the Lion King Organization, yes?

00:22:44.810 --> 00:22:49.380
I am First Lieutenant Ueyanagi of the JSDF 
Special Attack Mage Regiment, 2nd Company.

00:22:49.380 --> 00:22:52.260
Major Azama has ordered us 
to act as an escort

00:22:52.260 --> 00:22:54.640
after receiving a report of an attack here.

00:22:55.090 --> 00:22:58.990
We will henceforth assume command here.

00:22:59.440 --> 00:23:02.440
Give Glenda to us, Attack Mage Haba.

00:23:02.560 --> 00:23:04.050
Yuiri...

00:23:05.010 --> 00:23:05.910
But...

00:23:06.150 --> 00:23:08.030
You refuse to obey us?

00:23:10.250 --> 00:23:11.490
Wait just a minute.

00:23:11.720 --> 00:23:14.390
You seem like you're in quite a hurry,

00:23:14.390 --> 00:23:16.460
but would you answer one thing for me first?

00:23:16.660 --> 00:23:22.420
Glenda only just shared her name, 
and only with the person she likes most.

00:23:22.690 --> 00:23:24.540
So how did <i>you</i> know it?

00:23:26.280 --> 00:23:28.420
Until you can explain that,

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:30.800
we're not letting you have her.

00:23:31.350 --> 00:23:34.090
I sensed something was off from the start.

00:23:34.090 --> 00:23:36.620
It didn't make sense for the 
JSDF to conduct this mission

00:23:36.620 --> 00:23:38.060
on the premise that civilians would be hurt.

00:23:38.330 --> 00:23:41.360
Plus, despite operating under such a plan,

00:23:41.360 --> 00:23:44.610
the JSDF's elite, 
the Special Attack Mage Regiment,

00:23:44.880 --> 00:23:46.960
turned out to be surprisingly weak.

00:23:47.340 --> 00:23:48.830
Was that because

00:23:48.830 --> 00:23:54.570
the Attack Mage Regiment wasn't suitably 
equipped to deal with magical beasts?

00:23:54.770 --> 00:23:56.640
There was no helping that.

00:23:56.640 --> 00:23:59.990
No one could have predicted 
the appearance of so many Houdas.

00:23:59.990 --> 00:24:01.310
If that's the case,

00:24:01.720 --> 00:24:06.150
what did you think would 
appear, Major Azama?

00:24:06.490 --> 00:24:07.510
No...

00:24:07.720 --> 00:24:09.470
Knight of the Sinful God?!
